A_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucZtg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/good%20first%20issue","name":"good first issue","color":"7057ff","default":true,"description":"Good for newcomers"},{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071106,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuSAg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/community","name":"community","color":"5319E7","default":false,"description":"Community engagement"},{"id":10360962887,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACaY-_Rw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/onboarding","name":"onboarding","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":625,"created_at":"2026-04-02T15:42:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-07T05:03:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Bounty: 3 RTC\n\n### What You'll Do\nResearch RustChain and compare it to another blockchain project you know.\n\n### Steps\n1. **Pick any other blockchain project**: Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, Ergo, Chia, whatever you know\n2. **Write a comparison** (300-800 words) covering:\n   - Consensus mechanism differences (PoW vs PoS vs PoA vs RustChain's Proof of Antiquity)\n   - Hardware requirements\n   - Environmental approach\n   - Community model\n   - What each project does better\n3. **Post as a comment here**\n\n### What Counts\n- Must show you actually read about both projects\n- Honest comparison, it's fine to say where RustChain falls short\n- We learn from your outside perspective\n- Tables/charts welcome but not required\n\n### Payment\n3 RTC for a thoughtful, accurate comparison.\n\n**Difficulty**: Easy-Medium | **Time**: 30-45 min | **Skills**: Research, writing\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/reactions","total_count":14,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":3,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2786/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93730","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93730/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93730/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/93730/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/93730","id":4676194166,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc8AAAABFrkPdg","number":93730,"title":"[$250] Fullstory - The session is not shown in fullstory for a user created on Prod","user":{"login":"lanitochka17","id":78819774,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4ODE5Nzc0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/78819774?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lanitochka17","html_url":"https://github.com/lanitochka17","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lanitochka17/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lanitochka17/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lanitochka17/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lanitochka17/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lanitochka17/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lanitochka17/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lanitochka17/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lanitochka17/events{/privacy}","received_