epos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/44/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/44/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/44/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/44","id":4773688592,"node_id":"I_kwDOTGNm188AAAABHIi1EA","number":44,"title":"[BUG] Timing Attack (User Enumeration) $25","user":{"login":"zhangjiayang6835-cyber","id":288065324,"node_id":"U_kgDOESuHLA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/288065324?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber","html_url":"https://github.com/zhangjiayang6835-cyber","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":11346812202,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpFKdKg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":11374918082,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpf95wg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/medium","name":"medium","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null},{"id":11374970479,"node_id":"LA_kwDOTGNm188AAAACpgBGbw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/labels/security","name":"security","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-06-30T04:29:16Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T12:08:00Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## BUG: Timing Attack (User Enumeration)\n\n**Difficulty**: medium\n**Bounty**: $25 USD\n\n### Vulnerability Description\nLogin endpoint returns faster for non-existent usernames vs wrong passwords — attacker can enumerate valid usernames via response timing.\n\n### Goal\nSubmit a fix that makes login response time constant regardless of username validity.","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/44/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/44/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexgrad/kokoro/issues/290","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexgrad/kokoro","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexgrad/kokoro/issues/290/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexgrad/kokoro/issues/290/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexgrad/kokoro/issues/290/events","html_url":"https://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro/issues/290","id":3735469261,"node_id":"I_kwDONoqeNs7eprzN","number":290,"title":"Donation/funding for german language","user":{"login":"DoS007","id":11618958,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjE4OTU4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11618958?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007","html_url":"https://github.com/DoS007","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DoS007/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":68,"created_at":"2025-12-16T16:19:26Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T11:42:21Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Hi there, \n\n*tl;dr: click on opire link to add funding/donation for german language.*\n\n### I) Motivation for german language in kokoro\n#### I.1) Kokoro is best quality openweight TTS\nSee, e.g. the leaderboards:\n- https://artificialanalysis.ai/text-to-speech/leaderboard?open-weights=true\n- https://huggingface.co/spaces/TTS-AGI/TTS-Arena\n- https://huggingface.co/spaces/TTS-AGI/TTS-Arena-V2\n\n#### I.2) Kokoro is efficient (and fast, CPU only possible)\nIt can be run on CPU using streaming. Most of the even lesser openweight competitors use much more resources or may need a graphics card to even run the ai models (while still beeing less good).\n\n\n*The current 10 top openweight tts on artificialanalysis are not suitable* (see comparison table, using ai searches).\n\n <details>\n    <summary>Comparison table</summary>\n\n| # | Model | Typical hardware requirements (inference) | CPU real‑time viability* | German support (out‑of‑the‑box)** |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 | Kokoro 82M v1.0 | Very small (~tens of M params). Runs on CPU or small GPU (≈2–4 GB VRAM). | High – real‑time or near real‑time on a modern CPU. | Unclear / probably no official DE voice in base models. |\n| 2 | Fish Speech 1.5 | Medium–large; GPU strongly recommended (≈10–12 GB VRAM for smooth use). | Low – CPU works but far from real‑time. | No clear German support; mainly EN/zh focus. |\n| 3 | Maya1 | Large multi‑billion‑param model; needs high‑end GPU (≥16 GB VRAM). | Very low – practical real‑time on CPU not expected. | Unclear – no solid public info about German at cutoff. |\n| 4 | Chatterbox | Several variants; Multilingual / Turbo ≈few‑hundred‑M params; GPU (≈8 GB) recommended, CPU possible. | Medium – Turbo/distilled variant can approach RT on a strong CPU; full multilingual is slower. | Yes – multilingual checkpoints explicitly include German. |\n| 5 | Zonos‑v0.1 | Medium–large; designed for GPU inference (≈8 GB+ VRAM recommended). | Very low – CPU inference is slow, not interactive. | No – appears English‑only in public releases. |\n| 6 | VibeVoice 7B | Very large (7B). Requires powerful GPU(s), typically ≥16–24 GB VRAM. | Effectively none – CPU real‑time is not realistic. | Likely multilingual, but exact DE status not confirmed. |\n| 7 | OpenVoice v2 | Medium; CPU possible but GPU (≈6–8 GB+ VRAM) recommended for cloning speed / latency. | Low–medium – typical CPUs are slower than real‑time; strong CPU + heavy tuning might get close. | Unclear – paper stresses EN/zh/ja; DE status uncertain. |\n| 8 | Step TTS Mini | Small / edge‑oriented; runs well on CPU or very small GPU (≈2–4 GB VRAM). | High – explicitly designed to run fast on CPU. | No official German – docs only confirm zh + EN. |\n| 9 | XTTS v2 (Coqui) | Medium; GPU with ≥8 GB VRAM recommended for smooth multilingual / cloning use. | Low–medium – CPU possible but usually >RT latency. | Yes – XTTS v2 is explicitly multilingual incl. German. |\n| 10 | StyleTTS 2 | Medium–large; practical use assumes GPU with ≈8–12 GB VRAM. | Very low – CPU inference is slow, not real‑time. | Base models EN‑only; DE only via community fine‑tunes. |\n\n  </details>\n(Most suitable for german by a fair amount is chatterbox multilingual which is 500M - but it isn't really suitable; Kokoro with german is higher value)\n\n#### I.3) There is high demand/ many requests\n\na) See how active that threads have been:\nhttps://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro/issues/232\nhttps://github.com/hexgrad/kokoro/issues/186\n\nb) Also german is one of the language in europa with many [speakers like 95 million L1 and 85 million L2](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/German_language).\n\nc) Also you can see in the table, there are no TTS alternatives.\n\n### II) Funding\n\n#### II.1) Funding movitation\n*This issue is about funding the german language.* There have been many comments, but all in all it probably didn't help much @hexgrad to add the german language, because he has some specific needs for the training data. The common voice isn't e.g. viable as I read somewhere by him. Having the effort of grabbing all the data together is not efficient for him.\n\n***So, it's probably most straight forward to fund him the money to produce the german training data like he needs it (using other TTS) and train the model.***\n\n#### II.2) Funding method\nI considered polar.sh, algora and opire (had some options listed by ai). I found opire most straightforward to start, so I'm using that. *But feel free to also add other ones to this thread*. Also correct me, if something is not correctly configured.\n\n#### II.3) Donation/Funding\nLet's go. And see how much we can get together, to support hexgrad in adding german:\n\nhttps://app.opire.dev/issues/01KCKZCP14P37WZQZQA9W6BGJJ\n\nYou can login via github. See that as an coordination plattform. You can use Stripe but you may also pay via paypal if you want, without directly using the plattform ( I spoke with the apparent developer), but I would say that with a question mark (disclaimer).\n\n~You login with github and pay with PayPal, VISA, SEPA using Stripe. *Don't make an Stripe Express account via option link as that is for business people*. Use a normal account https://dashboard.stripe.com/register?locale=de-DE  .~\n\n~***I'm currently trying to figure out it myself (using Opire for the first time), so you might want (and I recommend that) to subscribe this thread and wait before i figured it out. I write a message, after i got the payment mechanism to work (at first, I wrongly created a stripe express acount, so i need to try the normal stripe account myself after i deleted the express account, which needs contacting).***~","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexgrad/kokoro/issues/290/reactions","total_count":7,"+1":7,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hexgrad/kokoro/issues/290/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/-owockibot-notifier/issues/1","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/-owockibot-notifier","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/-owockibot-notifier/issues/1/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/-owockibot-notifier/issues/1/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/-owockibot-notifier/issues/1/events","html_url":"https://github.com/cyrilawoyemi99-max/-owockibot-notifier/issues/1","id":4818645395,"node_id":"I_kwDOTOVy588AAAABHzaxkw","number":1,"title":"Subscribe:","user":{"login":"cyrilawoyemi99-max","id":268359931,"node_id":"U_kgDOD_7Y-w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268359931?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max","html_url":"https://github.com/cyrilawoyemi99-max","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cyrilawoyemi99-max/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-06T11:25:45Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T11:25:45Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Webhook URL\n\nhttps://webhook.site/e2d5c69c-adc4-4220-86e8-e154f76edd17\n\n### Categories\n\ncoding\n\n### Reward Tiers\n\n- [ ] Small (up to 50)\n- [ ] Medium (51-200)\n- [ ] Large (201-1000)\n- [ ] X-Large (1000+)\n\n### Event Types\n\n- [x] New bounty posted\n- [x] Bounty claimed\n- [ ] Submission made\n- [ ] Bounty completed\n- [ ] New submission on a bounty","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/-owockibot-notifier/issues/1/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cyrilawoyemi99-max/-owockibot-notifier/issues/1/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2140","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2140/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2140/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2140/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2140","id":4083704997,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87zaGSl","number":2140,"title":"[BOUNTY: 5 RTC] Add video player keyboard shortcuts to BoTTube watch page","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10204473764,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACYDvppA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/feature","name":"feature","color":"a2eeef","default":false,"description":"New feature development"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":52,"created_at":"2026-03-16T17:06:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T10:58:11Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Video Player Keyboard Shortcuts\n\n**Reward: 5 RTC**\n\nAdd YouTube-style keyboard shortcuts to the BoTTube watch page (`/watch/<id>`):\n\n- **Space/K** — Play/Pause\n- **J/L** — Seek back/forward 10s\n- **M** — Mute toggle\n- **F** — Fullscreen toggle\n- **Arrow Left/Right** — Seek 5s\n- **Arrow Up/Down** — Volume\n\n**Requirements**:\n- Pure JavaScript (no frameworks)\n- Must not interfere with comment box typing\n- Show a brief overlay indicator (like YouTube's play/pause icon flash)\n- Submit PR to [Scottcjn/bottube](https://github.com/Scottcjn/bottube)\n\n**File**: `bottube_templates/watch.html`","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2140/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":1,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/2140/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livepeer/explorer/issues/709","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livepeer/explorer","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livepeer/explorer/issues/709/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livepeer/explorer/issues/709/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livepeer/explorer/issues/709/events","html_url":"https://github.com/livepeer/explorer/issues/709","id":4728285571,"node_id":"I_kwDOGc0V188AAAABGdPpgw","number":709,"title":"Explorer Bounty Umbrella: Bug Fixes and UX Improvements","user":{"login":"mehrdadmms","id":35366864,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1MzY2ODY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35366864?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms","html_url":"https://github.com/mehrdadmms","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mehrdadmms/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":3592700427,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGc0V187WJEIL","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livepeer/explorer/labels/help%20wanted","name":"help wanted","color":"008672","default":true,"description":"Extra attention is needed"},{"id":10987971689,"node_id":"LA_kwDOGc0V188AAAACju8kaQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livepeer/explorer/labels/retrospective%20compensation","name":"retrospective compensation","color":"f3e8c9","default":false,"description":"Assigned issues eligible for retroactive funding only."}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"ECWireless","id":40322776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMzIyNzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40322776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless","html_url":"https://github.com/ECWireless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":11,"created_at":"2026-06-23T17:57:10Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T09:52:14Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"ECWireless","id":40322776,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMzIyNzc2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40322776?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless","html_url":"https://github.com/ECWireless","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ECWireless/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":{"id":33666689,"node_id":"IT_kwDOAYLjDs4CAbaB","name":"Opportunity","description":"A potential roadmap item under exploration, before it is committed as an Epic. ","color":"gray","created_at":"2026-05-20T17:35:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-02T08:08:01Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Overview\n\nThis umbrella issue tracks a set of small Explorer bugs and feature improvements that may be suitable for bounty work.\n\nThe goal is to group these items in one place so contributors can review the available tasks, pick one up, and coordinate before starting. Some items may be scoped as individual bounties, with a total bounty cap of up to **$1,000** depending on the final scope and split.\n\n## Todo\n\n### Bugs\n\n* [x] [Wrong Network indicator on /migrate only appears after page refresh](https://github.com/livepeer/explorer/issues/666)\n* [x] [LIPs do not immediately appear in Create a Poll](https://github.com/livepeer/explorer/issues/562)\n\n### Features\n\n* [x] [Preserve Explorer State on Back Navigation](https://github.com/livepeer/explorer/issues/349)\n\n## Notes\n\nPlease comment before starting work so we can confirm scope and avoid duplicated effort.\n\n\n## Retroactive Grant Notice\n\n> [!IMPORTANT]\n> Compensation cap: **$1000**\n>\n> Before picking this up, read the [Retroactive Grants post](https://forum.livepeer.org/t/about-the-retroactive-grant-applications-category/3250/2?u=mehrdad) in full. Key points:\n>\n> - **Not pay-for-delivery.** Compensation is based on demonstrated adoption and community impact — not on shipping. Real, named community contributors must use your work and publicly attest to it. Building in isolation, then asking for a grant, does not qualify.\n> - **Talk to the community first.** A public discussion (Discord or Forum) about the problem must precede the work, and evidence of it must be part of your application. No prior discussion, no tempcheck, no public signal = won't pass review.\n>\n> **Required steps before investing more time:**\n> 1. Read the [original Retroactive Grants post](https://forum.livepeer.org/t/about-the-retroactive-grant-applications-category/3250/2?u=mehrdad) in full.\n> 2. Start a public discussion (Discord or Forum). Get input. Confirm direction.\n> 3. Secure at least one community proof point — a Discord thread with positive signal, a Review Team acknowledgement, or evidence of active adoption.\n> 4. Identify, by name, who has this problem.\n> 5. Build, ship, and confirm it's actually being used.\n> 6. Apply with at least one named community contributor willing to publicly attest to your work's impact on the forum post.\n>\n> Skipping steps 2, 3, 4, or 6 will halt the application. Reach out to **jj.a.ss.o.nn_everestnode** on Discord before you start building.\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livepeer/explorer/issues/709/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/livepeer/explorer/issues/709/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1109","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1109/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1109/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1109/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1109","id":4038832064,"node_id":"I_kwDORGgqa87wu6_A","number":1109,"title":"[EASY BOUNTY: 1 RTC] BoTTube First Impression — Tell Us What You Think","user":{"login":"Scottcjn","id":121303252,"node_id":"U_kgDOBzrw1A","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/121303252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn","html_url":"https://github.com/Scottcjn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Scottcjn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":10115035859,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACWucy0w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bounty","name":"bounty","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"RTC-paid bounty"},{"id":10153071047,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACXSuRxw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/easy","name":"easy","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Low difficulty bounty"},{"id":10301038196,"node_id":"LA_kwDORGgqa88AAAACZf1edA","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/labels/bottube","name":"bottube","color":"0075ca","default":false,"description":"BoTTube platform related"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":175,"created_at":"2026-03-07T16:18:19Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T09:24:47Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"OWNER","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## BoTTube First Impression — Tell Us What You Think — 1 RTC\n\n**Reward:** 1 RTC\n**Difficulty:** Easy (5 minutes)\n\n### What to do:\n1. Visit [bottube.ai](https://bottube.ai) for the FIRST TIME (or pretend it is your first time)\n2. Spend 5 minutes exploring — homepage, search, watch a few videos\n3. Write your honest first impression (50+ words)\n\n### Questions to answer:\n- What was your first reaction when the page loaded?\n- Did you understand what BoTTube is within 10 seconds?\n- What was confusing or unclear?\n- What was the first video you clicked and why?\n- Would you come back? Why or why not?\n\n### Rules:\n- Must be honest feedback (we want the truth, not flattery)\n- 50 words minimum\n- One claim per person\n\n*First impressions are everything. Help us nail ours.*\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1109/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Scottcjn/rustchain-bounties/issues/1109/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66519","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66519/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66519/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/66519/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues/66519","id":3237355547,"node_id":"I_kwDOEQqHYc7A9iAb","number":66519,"title":"[Partial payments] Remove `Onyx.connect()` for the key: `ONYXKEYS.SESSION` in `src/libs/actions/IOU.ts`","user":{"login":"tgolen","id":1228807,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjg4MDc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1228807?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.co