 from BrowserStack:** https://github.com/Expensify/App/pull/92938\n**Email or phone of affected tester (no customers):** jsat@applausemail.com\n**Issue reported by:** Applause Internal Team\n**Bug source:** Exploratory - Significant User Experience Deterioration\n**Device used:** iPhone 13 mini/18.6.2\n**App Component:** Other\n\n## Action Performed:\n1. Launch Expensify App\n2. Log in with valid credentials\n3. Open Search\n4. Open a recent chat\n5. Type and send a message\n6. Go back using the top back button or swipe-back gesture\n7. Open the same chat again from Search\n\n## Expected Result:\nThe compose box should be empty after the message has been successfully sent.\n\n## Actual Result:\nWhen reopening the chat from Search, the previously sent message is still displayed in the compose box as if it were an unsent draft.\n\n## Workaround:\nUnknown\n\n## Platforms:\n- [ ] Android: App\n- [ ] Android: mWeb Chrome\n- [x] iOS: App\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Safari\n- [ ] iOS: mWeb Chrome\n- [ ] Windows: Chrome\n- [ ] MacOS: Chrome Safari\n\n## Screenshots/Videos\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9e11631b-95dc-48e1-9570-eb4d0980e1b5\n\n[View all open jobs on GitHub](https://github.com/Expensify/App/issues?q=is%3Aopen+is%3Aissue+label%3A%22Help+Wanted%22)\n\n\n> **Applause Internal Information**\n> Exported by: Svetlana Lazutkina\n> Bug ID: 7186008\n<details><summary>Upwork Automation - Do Not Edit</summary>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Upwork Job URL: <a href=\"https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022068322912791692610\">https://www.upwork.com/jobs/~022068322912791692610</a></li>\n        <li>Upwork Job ID: 2068322912791692610</li>\n        <li>Last Price Increase: 2026-07-04</li>\n    </ul>\n</details>","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94118/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Expensify/App/issues/94118/timeline","performed_via