/api.github.com/users/Async777/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Async777/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Async777/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Async777/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Async777/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Feature area\n\nIntegration logic/state\n\n### Problem or use case\n\nHey ccpk1!\n\nnot sure if this can already be done or is in the works already but it would be cool to like view a list of things that are up for grabs or bounty. It's a one time chore that never comes back but users can see how many points it will give them and pick up the bounty, and now it appears as theirs.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n### Proposed solution\n\nThe idea is like this:\n\nBounties\n- Fix shingle on roof  [100 points] [Add to Chores]\n- fix bumper on car [1000 points] [Add to Chores]\n- install new laundry tub [250 points] [Add to Chores]\n\nthis is different from things you know will reoccur, ie change winter tires, or wash windows, vacuum, etc\n\n### Expected outcome\n\nIf this is already possible I apologize!\n\n### Alternatives considered\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional context\n\n_No response_","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ccpk1/ChoreOps/issues/89/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ccpk1/ChoreOps/issues/89/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null,"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-research/issues/98","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhangjiayang6835-cyber/ai-re